  "prefLabel": "Acp 705.02 Board Approval of NADA-Equivalent Training Programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 705.02 Board Approval of NADA-Equivalent Training Programs. The board shall approve any 70-hour mixed didactic and clinical training program that demonstrates it meets the requirements of Acp 705.03-705.05. Programs seeking approval under this part shall submit documentation sufficient to demonstrate compliance with these requirements no later than 4 months before offering the training program for the first time.\n\nSource. #12575, eff 7-20-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/acp100-700.html"
